# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the nightly tsan job (docs/Testing.md#ci). Only for
# races inside third-party code we build but do not own; name the library and why.

# SDL3's HIDAPI libusb backend stops its event thread through a plain int flag
# (src/hidapi/libusb/hid.c, stop_event_thread); the race is on SDL's shutdown, inside SDL.
race:stop_event_thread
